{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220972","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220972","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1322097201:1":{"text":"あなたが、あのモンスターを倒して、息子を助けてくれたの……？","source_cn":"你……是你杀了那个怪物，救了他……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FE9A36B182759F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322097202:1":{"text":"彼一人の力でも十分通用したがな。だが、今はまだ力を上手く扱えないようだ。","source_cn":"其实他自己的力量足以与那个怪物对抗，只是他还没有熟悉怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D1A4B04E3BDD8DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322097203:1":{"text":"僕は、ダイモンの気持ちがよく分かる……","source_cn":"雪米拉女士，你知道吗？其实我很理解戴蒙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD898EF6F01E54F4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322097204:1":{"text":"僕も子どもの頃は体が弱く、ほとんど家から出られずに、友人たちと過ごすこともできなかった。","source_cn":"我小时候身体也很差，大部分时间都在家里待着，不能和别的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0565E72F84E1A3B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322097205:1":{"text":"両親は僕にできる限りのものを与えてくれた。豪華な衣服、高価な画材、この世の素晴らしいものすべてを……けれど、それでも僕の寂しさが消えることはなかった。","source_cn":"我的父母倾尽全力给我最好的生活——华美的服饰、精致的画...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2A96E8ACE89426D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322097206:1":{"text":"かつての僕が何よりも望んでいたのは、同年齢の子どもたちと外で走り回り、はしゃぎ、泥だらけになることだったんだ。結局、死ぬまで叶うことはなかったがな……","source_cn":"我曾经最希望的，就是能和其他同龄人一起在外面奔跑、打闹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D1D39E93560ED4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322097207:1":{"text":"そしてグレイヴボーンとなった今、あまりにも多くの死と、人間の恐怖に満ちた視線を見てきた僕は、もう友情を望む気にはなれない……","source_cn":"而现在，成为了亡灵，经历了这么长的岁月，见过了太多的生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x797C06BD4D2BA423","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322097208:0":{"text":"だがそれでも、時々思うのだよ。幼い頃の記憶の欠片が、ふと脳裏に浮かぶとき……病床に伏せっていた頃、もっと友人を作っておけば良かったと。","source_cn":"可童年的碎片掠影偶尔浮现时，我还是会想着……如果那时卧...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CEF120D3D21F36C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322097209:1":{"text":"……そうなの？","source_cn":"……是这样的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D17961D7769553C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322097210:1":{"text":"たとえそれで、あなたの病状が悪化して、両親が悲しむことになっても？","source_cn":"即便那会加重你的病情，让你的父母垂泪……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BDABEFFAD05B638","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322097211:1":{"text":"たとえ両親でも、子どもの代わりに選択する権利はない。","source_cn":"即便是父母，也无权替自己的子女做出选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EEE6261A159FF87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322097212:1":{"text":"人はいつだって、子どもの頃手に入らなかったものを求める。大人になった子どもは、常に過去の後悔を補おうとしているのだ。","source_cn":"人总是会奢求童年时无法得到的东西。孩子长大后的每一天，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5E1E4C9ADAD707D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322097213:1":{"text":"君の息子を信じたまえ。死の経験は、彼に成長をもたらした。","source_cn":"相信你的儿子吧，只要经历过生死，他就已经长大了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x580C49592FFE82CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322097214:1":{"text":"君は彼を信じ、理解し、尊重するだけでいい。現にあの子は自分で自分を守り、友人とも出会えた。そうだろう？","source_cn":"你只要理解他，相信他，尊重他——他说能保护好自己，能交...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x218EE1517A5DEAAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322097215:1":{"text":"ええ、そうね……ここに来るまでの間も、あの子はとても良くやったと思うわ……","source_cn":"……是的，他做到了。这一路上，他的确做得很好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8774F36E0AA98D71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_titl